<title>MALAYSIA: Time Engineering to list telecom unit.</title>
<headline>Time Engineering to list telecom unit.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Time Engineering Bhd said on Monday that it plans to list its TIME Telecommunications Holdings Bhd unit on the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company made the statement in an advisory about a news conference to be held on Monday at 4 p.m. (0800 GMT) to announce the flotation of the unit.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>Shares of Time were off 15 cents to 5.35 ringgit in Monday morning trading.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
